    <item>
      <title>0.8.0</title>
      <link>https://github.com/joceqo/crier/releases/tag/v0.8.0</link>
      <sparkle:version>0.8.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cursor support fixed</strong>: parser now reads Cursor's <code>role:"assistant"</code> transcript envelope, the project name is recovered from <code>transcript_path</code> when stdin reports <code>~/.cursor</code>, and duplicate stop hooks (cursor + claude-code firing for one cursor turn) are deduped server-side so you see one overlay per turn instead of two.</li>
          <li><strong>Reveal Logs in Finder…</strong>: new menu item stages every Crier log into a single folder and opens Finder there for quick triage.</li>
          <li>Send Feedback now embeds the tails of <code>crier-ui.log</code>, <code>crier-emit.log</code>, and the empty-message diagnostic inline.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 08:50:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/joceqo/crier/releases/download/v0.8.0/Crier.app.zip" length="4160707" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="wk6rioDypGKUpgiRRRnZt1utZouXmqwKUmRgiwnk4wFyuH0LGf64YhwreY/dzd5oq4GEfZXwHTUhF6Xeje8iAQ==" sparkle:minimumSystemVersion="14.0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.7.1</title>
      <link>https://github.com/joceqo/crier/releases/tag/v0.7.1</link>
      <sparkle:version>0.7.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Hook installer no longer writes <strong>App Translocation</strong> paths — Cursor/Claude/Codex configs keep working after Crier quits.</li>
          <li>If you launched Crier only from Downloads/DMG, Setup now asks you to drag the app into <strong>Applications</strong> before wiring hooks.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 21:35:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/joceqo/crier/releases/download/v0.7.1/Crier.app.zip" length="4137812" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="R/xQpjJFf4S+sETGaCIgOen1ze0z0nehTZ3wGseYSR8UCVHVT0BeXaneFny7aEGh0a8imYC6boTsVLJzUSL5Aw==" sparkle:minimumSystemVersion="14.0" />
