      <sparkle:version>0.7.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Pause</strong> in the menu bar: silence hooks for <strong>10</strong> or <strong>30 minutes</strong>, or cancel anytime.</li>
          <li>Works with global disable; <code>crier-emit</code> honors the same pause file when the UI is not running.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
